  "details": "- KVM: x86/mmu: Ensure hugepage is in by slot before checking max mapping level {CVE-2026-63807}\n- KVM: x86: Check for invalid/obsolete root *after* making MMU pages available {CVE-2026-64561}\n- comedi: vmk80xx: fix bulk-buffer overflow {CVE-2021-47474}\n- staging: vme_user: Fix possible UAF in tsi148_dma_list_add {CVE-2022-50384}\n- net/sched: teql: fix NULL pointer dereference in iptunnel_xmit on TEQL slave xmit {CVE-2026-23277}\n- net: mana: fix use-after-free in add_adev() error path {CVE-2026-43056}\n- dm cache: fix null-deref with concurrent writes in passthrough mode {CVE-2026-53064}\n- signal: clear JOBCTL_PENDING_MASK for caller in zap_other_threads() {CVE-2026-53352}\n- wifi: rtlwifi: pci: fix possible use-after-free caused by unfinished irq_prepare_bcn_tasklet {CVE-2026-53112}\n- bpf: Reject variable offset alu on PTR_TO_FLOW_KEYS {CVE-2024-26589}\n- ipv6: prevent possible UaF in addrconf_permanent_addr() {CVE-2026-43339}\n- KVM: nSVM: Always use vmcb01 in VMLOAD/VMSAVE emulation {CVE-2026-43133}\n- netfilter: nf_conntrack_h323: fix OOB read in decode_choice() {CVE-2026-43233}\n- Bluetooth: SMP: force responder MITM requirements before building the pairing response {CVE-2026-43334}\n- nbd: fix uaf in nbd_genl_connect() error path {CVE-2025-38443}\n- drm/i915/hwmon: Get rid of devm {CVE-2024-39479}\n- scsi: megaraid_sas: Fix invalid node index {CVE-2025-38239}\n- vsock: fix buffer size clamping order {CVE-2026-46234}\n- net: ena: fix shift-out-of-bounds in exponential backoff {CVE-2023-53272}",
